      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALWAYSBJOY NZ (2) led from a couple of spots wider and found winning form in her heat on Tuesday, digging deep to get home narrowly. That should have brought her to peak fitness and she has built a strong record at this circuit and distance. Has the speed to take advantage of the low draw so can strike again. SWEET ROCKY (1) is another that led from wider and kept going to score by 5,5m on Tuesday. Should be prominent again from the inside barrier. Big chance. VINKE B NZ (8) made it two wins on the trot at this circuit and distance when he covered ground before getting home by 1.2 metres. Draws on the back row but can trail SWEET ROCKY. Danger. MIKI B NZ (9) has worked his way into peak fitness, overcoming a wide barrier and proving too tough on Tuesday. With even luck from the back row he is a player again.",
